{"version":2,"sourceHash":"1822d08b1cf0edd0475c92c0afa22fe040cec6e8e632f2e40817de52b7dfdd2e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-27","no":"EP.27","tag":"第27話 · 剛出爐的早晨","title":"剛出爐的早晨","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-1","s":"n","t":"渡船行至河心，她又攤開手掌。夜風穿過五指，可仍不像自己的手。","bg":"river","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"neutral"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"},"bgm":"riverReturn","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-2","s":"yeon","t":"你也歇一會兒吧。從剛才起就一直用受傷的爪子撐著。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-3","s":"n","t":"貓挪位置時踉蹌，她本能托住小前爪，腕上的庚字便暖了。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-4","s":"neo","t":"等一下，別鬆手。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-5","s":"n","t":"白毛尖泛光，包住小小身體。帽下額頭的四紋依次亮起，沉向手腕。她掌中小前爪，自粉紅肉墊起緩緩伸長。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-6","s":"sys","t":"［ 庚 · 連線修復／外形恢復 ］"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-7","s":"n","t":"光散後，銀髮男人坐在船底。小深藍披風延成長繡金銀外套，她握住的已是人的手。","neoForm":"human","r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"fx":"reveal","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"reveal","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-8","s":"yeon","t":"……Yeongnyangi？"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-9","s":"neo","t":"是我。這模樣時，叫你起的名字，Neo。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-10","s":"n","t":"他屈伸陌生的手指，左手背的鏽痕，在人皮膚上也一樣蔓延。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-11","s":"yeon","t":"你的手好暖。還和剛才一樣疼嗎？"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-12","s":"neo","t":"一點。變成人，也不是全好了。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-13","s":"n","t":"她讓出位置，他曲起陌生的膝蓋坐下。兩人肩膀第一次在相同高度碰到。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-14","s":"yeon","t":"那就慢慢習慣吧。我不也是剛變回來嗎。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-15","s":"neo","t":"嗯，今天借一下你的肩。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-16","s":"n","t":"摩卡遲遲醒來，來回看兩人，揉兩次眼，捋一下鬍鬚。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-17","s":"moka","t":"貓也是人？豬也是人，這船上只剩我一個獸了嗎。"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-boat-1","s":"n","t":"嘴上抱怨，摩卡還是把毯子搭上Neo肩。"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-boat-2","s":"moka","t":"吃過再解釋。你倆都抖著呢。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-18","s":"n","t":"她笑，Neo也微笑。臉陌生，困窘時避開視線的習慣卻沒變，她這才鬆了握手的力道。"},{"id":"ep-27:1","s":"n","t":"船沿河走了一夜。天將亮，賣時間之島的熟悉碼頭出現，巷尾飄來烤麵包香。","bg":"jae","bgm":"orientalGirl","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:2","s":"ln","t":"姐姐快出來，客人來了！不，不是客人——","x":"greet","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"c":{"who":"ln","x":"greet"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-27:3","s":"yeon","t":"露娜！","x":"happy"},{"id":"ep-27:4","s":"ln","t":"咦，聲音是豬姐姐，臉卻是人？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:5","s":"yeon","t":"就是小豬姊姊。現在是人類姊姊了。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27:6","s":"ln","t":"哇，真是人！有手指，能拿麵包了吧！","x":"cheer"},{"id":"ep-27:7","s":"n","t":"露娜拉著她的手上下晃，新奇地逐根摸手指。"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-1","s":"n","t":"目光隨後停在她身後的銀髮男人，銀外套衣角粘著一根白毛。"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-2","s":"ln","t":"等等，貓哥哥呢？難道貓也是人？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-3","s":"moka","t":"我在船上也問過，一模一樣。沒人答我。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-4","s":"neo","t":"也是貓。只是現在不是。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-5","s":"ln","t":"那尾巴去哪兒了？鬍子呢？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-6","s":"n","t":"露娜掀外套衣角找尾巴。Neo僵著看她，她忍笑轉過頭。"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-7","s":"yeon","t":"他說這模樣叫Neo。尾巴我也沒找到。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27:8","s":"lns","t":"露娜，先把手上的麵糰弄完再玩。啊，是客人們。","x":"knead","c":{"who":"lns","x":"knead"}},{"id":"ep-27:9","s":"n","t":"露娜姐姐圍裙沾粉走來，逐個打量，笑得像嘆氣。"},{"id":"ep-27:10","s":"lns","t":"連Neo先生也變成人了。驚訝留到以後，先看胳膊和尾巴。","x":"sigh"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-nickname","s":"lns","t":"不過叫順嘴了，還叫貓先生可以吧？"},{"id":"ep-27:11","s":"moka","t":"尾巴本來就這樣！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:12","s":"lns","t":"都進來，洗手、坐下、吃飯，按順序。","x":"orders"},{"id":"ep-27:13","s":"n","t":"店裡暖和，剛出爐麵包蒸汽盈架，壁鐘也恢復了自己的速度。","bg":"jae","bgm":"teaKind","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:14","s":"lns","t":"今天第一爐。不收錢，但要吃完。","x":"bread","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"bliss"},"c":{"who":"lns","x":"bread"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"}},{"id":"ep-27:15","s":"yeon","t":"味道全在，是有滋味的香氣。","x":"bliss"},{"id":"ep-27:16","s":"moka","t":"這下能用手吃了。燙，慢慢吃。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27:17","s":"yeon","t":"我知道。可是太香了，實在等不及。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-27:luck-1","s":"n","t":"露娜遞她一塊抹黃油的麵包，麵包從指尖滑下，黃油麵朝地。"},{"id":"ep-27:luck-2","s":"ln","t":"咦？再來，我再拿！","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:luck-3","s":"n","t":"第二、第三塊也同一面落地。摩卡拿的、Neo拿的，卻都好好的。"},{"id":"ep-27:luck-4","s":"yun","t":"運氣見底，就會在這種地方露出來。下塊請連盤子一起接。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-27:18","s":"n","t":"姐姐連盤放到她面前。她咬一口，就停住。麵包溫熱，黃油的甜在舌尖慢慢化開。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:19","s":"yeon","t":"真好吃。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-27:20","s":"neo","t":"哭了？太燙嗎。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:21","s":"yeon","t":"不知道。賬本收走了運氣，好像把滋味留給我了。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-27:22","s":"n","t":"姐姐無聲再放一塊。她邊吃邊哭，誰也沒笑。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:23","s":"lns","t":"運氣拿得走，胃口可拿不走。那是長在身上的。","x":"blanket"},{"id":"ep-27:24","s":"n","t":"姐姐說完回爐前，背比以前彎了些，是賣掉的時間尚未全還回來的背。"},{"id":"ep-27:25","s":"yun","t":"姐姐，您的出生年月日時？這麵包，食神一定很好。","x":"sly","c":{"who":"yun","x":"sly"}},{"id":"ep-27:26","s":"lns","t":"算命先生，吃麵包的時候把嘴閉上。這是本店的規矩。","x":"orders"},{"id":"ep-27:27","s":"yun","t":"好的。我喜歡規矩。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27:28","s":"neo","t":"這規矩我喜歡。","x":"smirk"},{"id":"ep-27:29","s":"n","t":"吃飽的人陸續離座，她拿麵包袋坐後門臺階。Neo坐旁邊拉下左袖，仍遮不全手背鏽痕。","bg":"jae","tone":"dark","bgm":"neo2","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"soft"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"},"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:30","s":"yeon","t":"別遮了。我都看過了。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:31","s":"n","t":"Neo遲疑了一下，捲起袖子。鏽色停在肩膀下方。外形變了，傷卻沒有消失。"},{"id":"ep-27:32","s":"yeon","t":"我說讓你走開，收回了。我就是為了說這句話才去河邊的。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:33","s":"neo","t":"我知道。我聽見了。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-27:34","s":"yeon","t":"聽見了？在哪裡？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:35","s":"neo","t":"河下游。你的聲音，比水聲更大。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:36","s":"yeon","t":"這種事幹嘛記得。","x":"shy"},{"id":"ep-27:37","s":"neo","t":"我也答應你。疼就說，不瞞。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:38","s":"yeon","t":"說好了。客服違約可是要扣星的。","x":"serious","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:39","s":"neo","t":"好。你也別滅火，等水化開，我們一起撐。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-27:40","s":"n","t":"她掰麵包送他嘴邊，他沒有推辭。兩人默默嚼了許久。"},{"id":"ep-27:petal-1","s":"n","t":"Neo看著她髮間花夾。頭頂的花在人形時留下這小發夾，五片中一片仍白得像紙。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:petal-2","s":"yeon","t":"這片好像回不來了。沒事，夾子還是漂亮的。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:41","s":"n","t":"回到店裡時，露娜已經抱著下一爐的麵糰跑來跑去。","bg":"jae","bgm":"teaKind","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"c":{"who":"lns","x":"knead"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"},"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:ember-1","s":"n","t":"爐旁摩卡正把火種夾進小陶罐，每夾一下，須尖便燻黑一點。","c":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-27:ember-2","s":"yeon","t":"什麼罐？烤麵包用的？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-27:ember-3","s":"moka","t":"火種罐。祭典島的爐子全滅了，從這裡借點火帶回去。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27:ember-4","s":"lns","t":"蓋好能撐三天，路上別開啟看。","x":"orders"},{"id":"ep-27:ember-5","s":"n","t":"摩卡把罐抱在懷裡，按了兩次蓋，神情與聊烤串時不同。"},{"id":"ep-27:42","s":"n","t":"太陽又高些，她端面包盤到窗旁。安靜巷子的牆上，幾隻聞香來的貓打盹。","bg":"jae","shot":"wide","im":true,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:43","s":"n","t":"對街簷影下，坐著一個黑影。破披風間，右前爪的黑環清晰可見。","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"c":null,"r":null},{"id":"ep-27:44","s":"yeon","t":"（老虎。）","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-27:45","s":"n","t":"老虎沒有看麵包店。是在裝作沒看。只有鼻尖，微微朝麵包香氣的方向偏了一點。"},{"id":"ep-27:46","s":"n","t":"她想開窗，手又停住。她一出去，老虎就會走。這點她似乎明白。"},{"id":"ep-27:47","s":"lns","t":"在看什麼呢？","x":"bread","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"c":{"who":"lns","x":"bread"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-27:48","s":"yeon","t":"啊，沒有。只是外面有人。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:49","s":"n","t":"露娜的姊姊朝窗外瞥了一眼。隨後一聲不吭，用紙包好一個剛出爐的麵包，拿著出了門。"},{"id":"ep-27:50","s":"n","t":"巷裡比店裡涼。姐姐走近簷下，老虎起身，披風滴水。","bg":"jae","tone":"desat","bgm":"lakeDawn","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"lns","x":"bread"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"tiger","x":"surprise"},"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:51","s":"tiger","t":"我只是路過。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:52","s":"lns","t":"是啊。路過的時候肚子餓了，對吧。","x":"bread"},{"id":"ep-27:53","s":"n","t":"姐姐遞麵包。老虎先看麵包，再看她的臉，像在算買什麼、多少錢、何時還。"},{"id":"ep-27:54","s":"tiger","t":"這個多少錢呢。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-27:55","s":"lns","t":"免費的。","x":"tired"},{"id":"ep-27:56","s":"tiger","t":"沒有免費的東西。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:57","s":"lns","t":"有啊。現在這裡就有一個。","x":"sigh"},{"id":"ep-27:58","s":"n","t":"老虎不伸手，姐姐也不等，直接掰開它前爪放上面包，再合攏免得掉。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:59","s":"lns","t":"趁熱吃。涼了就只是麵包了。","x":"blanket"},{"id":"ep-27:60","s":"n","t":"露娜的姊姊轉身走回店裡，一次也沒回頭。"},{"id":"ep-27:61","s":"n","t":"它站了很久，爪中麵包溫暖，黑環安靜得彷彿忘了收緊。","im":true,"fx":"heart","sfx":"chime","l":null,"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"water"},"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"heart","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:62","s":"tiger","t":"竟然免費嗎。","x":"water"},{"id":"ep-27:63","s":"n","t":"它沒吃，小心把麵包放進破披風，挨著藏鼓手孩子名字的地方，消失在影中。"},{"id":"ep-27:64","s":"n","t":"回到店裡的露娜姊姊，又開始揉麵，像什麼事也沒發生過。","bg":"jae","bgm":"teaKind","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"soft"},"c":{"who":"lns","x":"knead"},"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:65","s":"yeon","t":"姐姐，謝謝您。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:66","s":"lns","t":"謝什麼。麵包店就是給人麵包的地方。","x":"knead"},{"id":"ep-27:67","s":"n","t":"她沒再說。窗外簷下空了，溼痕直到日斜也沒幹。"},{"id":"ep-27:68","s":"n","t":"傍晚，通倉庫的舊門縫漏光。原以為爐光，金光卻如線從每條門縫漫出。","bgm":"fortuneReveal","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"sfx":"sparkle","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:69","s":"ln","t":"姐姐，倉庫門亮了！又是時間小偷？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:70","s":"lns","t":"那扇門本來打不開啊。","x":"sigh"},{"id":"ep-27:71","s":"n","t":"舊門木紋化成牌畫，邊緣刻星，中間畫開門，下方浮出的不是數字，是字母。","im":true,"fx":"tarot","sfx":"chime","shot":"wide","bg":"tarotDoor","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"tarot","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:72","s":"sys","t":"［ THE DOOR · 命運程式碼8/8確認 · 可歸返 · 同行限制 ］"},{"id":"ep-27:door-1","s":"sys","t":"［ 開啟 · 次日破曉／同行 · 借用一格者 ］"},{"id":"ep-27:73","s":"yeon","t":"認識，最初應用裡那張牌。按了它，我才來這裡。","x":"surprise","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-27:74","s":"neo","t":"歸返的門。只讓八字齊全的人，以及借用那人一格的人透過。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:75","s":"yeon","t":"那我能走，能回家？","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-27:76","s":"neo","t":"由你選。門明早開，落在哪裡，由門定。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-27:77","s":"n","t":"她向門邁一步，又停下回頭：摩卡、閏月、露娜、姐姐，還有Neo。"},{"id":"ep-27:78","s":"yeon","t":"大家一起走，對吧？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:79","s":"n","t":"沒人立即回答。閏月把戴手套的手貼向門，金線在手前驟斷。","bgm":"gloom","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:80","s":"sys","t":"[ 年 □□ · 月 □□ · 日 □□ · 時 ■■ · 7/8 · 無法通過 ]","im":true,"fx":"veil","sfx":"glitch","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"veil","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:81","s":"yun","t":"果然我不行，沒有時辰。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27:82","s":"yeon","t":"時辰？被青兔吃掉的那個？","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-27:83","s":"yun","t":"缺了八字之一，在這門眼裡就還沒完整。真傷心。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27:84","s":"yeon","t":"那就找啊。一起找到，再一起走。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:85","s":"yun","t":"小姐竟然願意等我。這就是我們八字相合的證據呢。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-27:86","s":"neo","t":"不是。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:87","s":"n","t":"閏月笑了。那個笑，過了很久才結束。"},{"id":"ep-27:88","s":"moka","t":"我也不走。","x":"base","c":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-27:89","s":"yeon","t":"摩卡？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:90","s":"moka","t":"我本就是這邊的水獺。得帶火種回祭典島，守住火。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:moka-stay-1","s":"moka","t":"再說把烤串的水獺帶去人間，立刻上新聞。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:91","s":"yeon","t":"可是……","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-27:92","s":"moka","t":"可是什麼可是。聽我說唱的人少一個，捨不得的就這件事。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:93","s":"moka","t":"別哭了，人類。比當豬的時候還難看。","x":"moved"},{"id":"ep-27:94","s":"n","t":"嘴上這樣說，它夾著火罐，額頭撞了一下她手背，像當日分給她氣息時。","fx":"fire","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"fire","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:95","s":"yeon","t":"那Neo呢？","x":"cry","c":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-27:96","s":"neo","t":"我去。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:97","s":"yeon","t":"為什麼？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:98","s":"neo","t":"我是借來的格子，格子走，我得跟著。客服也出差。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-27:99","s":"yeon","t":"到府服務值幾顆星？","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27:100","s":"neo","t":"五顆。河上你這樣說過。","x":"smirk"},{"id":"ep-27:101","s":"yeon","t":"連這也都聽見了。","x":"shock"},{"id":"ep-27:choice-1","s":"n","t":"門的金光低下來，似在等答覆。走，便要和眾人分別；留，房間裡留下的那天就會一直停著。","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:choice-2","s":"yeon","t":"我走。但今晚要在這裡睡。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:choice-3","s":"lns","t":"那先拿被子吧。明早麵包早點烤。","x":"blanket"},{"id":"ep-27:choice-4","s":"n","t":"那夜店裡燈亮到很晚。她把借來的被子拉至下巴，久久看倉庫門漏出的金光。"},{"id":"ep-27:102","s":"n","t":"次晨，她與Neo站在倉庫門前。露娜塞來麵包袋，姐姐只在爐前揮手。","bg":"tarotDoor","bgm":"riverReturn","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"},"r":null,"scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:103","s":"ln","t":"姐姐，再來。人姐姐、豬姐姐都好，一定再來。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-27:104","s":"yeon","t":"一定。下回我付錢買麵包。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-27:105","s":"lns","t":"沒我們家的好吃，可不收喔。","x":"tired"},{"id":"ep-27:106","s":"yun","t":"到了那邊，這裡也許會像夢般模糊。不過別太擔心。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27:107","s":"yeon","t":"不會模糊的。這麼好吃的麵包，怎麼忘得了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:108","s":"yun","t":"是啊。麵包是忘不了的。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27:109","s":"n","t":"他把戴手套的手放進口袋，沒說姐姐今早又問了他的名字。"},{"id":"ep-27:110","s":"n","t":"她握門柄，溫度像剛出爐的麵包。門開，金色晨風湧進來。","im":true,"fx":"stars","sfx":"door","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"stars","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:111","s":"n","t":"跨門檻時，她似聽見身後閏月極輕地念了另一個名字。不是閏月，聲音卻被風蓋過。"},{"id":"ep-27:112","s":"n","t":"門關上了。留在麵包店的人們望了那扇門許久。它又變回了一扇舊倉庫門。","bg":"tarotDoor","tone":"desat","shot":"quiet","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:113","s":"n","t":"無人看見的地方，幾滴雨滲進關上的門縫，朝那一邊，像追著誰。","sfx":"rain"}]}
